From c82aca6c3b4ab3aca97cba46e2fa0bc0369a37a0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Peter M <petermm@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 13:48:44 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] bsps/riscv: Add ESP32-C5 BSP (riscv/esp32c5db)

Add ESP32-C5 board support package (riscv/esp32c5db) with rv32imac
architecture and ilp32 ABI.

- Map unified 384 KiB HP SRAM (0x40800000 - 0x40860000)
- Set direct-boot signature header and flash window at 0x42000000
- Reserve 0x16000 (88 KiB) at the top of HP SRAM for ROM data, BSS, and stack
- Add ESP32-C5 interrupt matrix and INTPRI routing with 84 peripheral sources
- Adapt systimer, GPIO matrix (ngpios = 29), SPI, I2C, and watchdog registers
- Enable BSP_START_COPY_SECTIONS for flash data copying at boot

Signed-off-by: Peter M <petermm@gmail.com>
